    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0011",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "For example, the following code creates a text attachment from the [`UIImage`](uiimage.md) class using an SF symbol in a blue headline style and embeds it at the end of the [`NSMutableAttributedString`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/NSMutableAttributedString) class:",
      "normalizedSource": "For example, the following code creates a text attachment from the [`UIImage`](uiimage.md) class using an SF symbol in a blue headline style and embeds it at the end of the [`NSMutableAttributedString`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/NSMutableAttributedString) class:",
      "sourceHash": "8f924bf3a5cd68038c75e876469bf6bf6cf380abb7629607caae8d2e5356c435",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Attachments created with this method automatically adapt to the surrounding font and color attributes in attributed strings.",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nlet content = NSMutableAttributedString(string: \"Open \")\nguard let lockImage = UIImage(systemName: \"lock\") else {\n    return\n}\nlet attributes: [NSAttributedString.Key: Any] = [\n    .foregroundColor: UIColor.blue,\n    .font: UIFont.preferredFont(forTextStyle: .headline)\n]\nlet lockSymbol = NSMutableAttributedString(\n    attachment: NSTextAttachment(image: lockImage)\n)\nlockSymbol.addAttributes(attributes, \n                         range: NSRange(location: 0, length: 1))\ncontent.insert(lockSymbol, at: 5)\n\n```",
      "documentTitle": "init(image:)",
      "framework": "UIKit",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0012:0001",
      "blockId": "code:discussion:0012",
      "type": "preserve",
      "source": "```swift\nlet content = NSMutableAttributedString(string: \"Open \")\nguard let lockImage = UIImage(systemName: \"lock\") else {\n    return\n}\nlet attributes: [NSAttributedString.Key: Any] = [\n    .foregroundColor: UIColor.blue,\n    .font: UIFont.preferredFont(forTextStyle: .headline)\n]\nlet lockSymbol = NSMutableAttributedString(\n    attachment: NSTextAttachment(image: lockImage)\n)\nlockSymbol.addAttributes(attributes, \n                         range: NSRange(location: 0, length: 1))\ncontent.insert(lockSymbol, at: 5)\n\n```",
      "normalizedSource": "```swift let content = NSMutableAttributedString(string: \"Open \") guard let lockImage = UIImage(systemName: \"lock\") else { return } let attributes: [NSAttributedString.Key: Any] = [ .foregroundColor: UIColor.blue, .font: UIFont.preferredFont(forTextStyle: .headline) ] let lockSymbol = NSMutableAttributedString( attachment: NSTextAttachment(image: lockImage) ) lockSymbol.addAttributes(attributes, range: NSRange(location: 0, length: 1)) content.insert(lockSymbol, at: 5) ```",
      "sourceHash": "a24b91945a8f52d5bef14b99ebbc995f2b0eb824110e71950c9142d003e2bdc0",
      "translatable": false,
      "preserveReason": "code",
      "contextBefore": "For example, the following code creates a text attachment from the [`UIImage`](uiimage.md) class using an SF symbol in a blue headline style and embeds it at the end of the [`NSMutableAttributedString`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/NSMutableAttributedString) class:",
      "contextAfter": "Parameters",
      "documentTitle": "init(image:)",
      "framework": "UIKit",
      "ko": "```swift\nlet content = NSMutableAttributedString(string: \"Open \")\nguard let lockImage = UIImage(systemName: \"lock\") else {\n    return\n}\nlet attributes: [NSAttributedString.Key: Any] = [\n    .foregroundColor: UIColor.blue,\n    .font: UIFont.preferredFont(forTextStyle: .headline)\n]\nlet lockSymbol = NSMutableAttributedString(\n    attachment: NSTextAttachment(image: lockImage)\n)\nlockSymbol.addAttributes(attributes, \n                         range: NSRange(location: 0, length: 1))\ncontent.insert(lockSymbol, at: 5)\n\n```",
      "status": "preserved",
